OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with bright spells,
OL,6,Fand it should remain dry throughout
OL,7,Fthe day, with an increasingly sunny
OL,8,Fafternoon developing. However, it will
OL,9,Fturn cloudier across Devon and
OL,10,FCornwall by mid-afternoon. Feeling
OL,11,Fvery warm in the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining dry overnight with
OL,14,Fclear spells for many, variable
OL,15,Famounts of cloud will continue to feed
OL,16,Fin across Devon and Cornwall. Light
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
