OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA bright start, particularly
OL,6,Fin the east, with a cloudier start in
OL,7,Fthe west. However, this cloud will
OL,8,Flift and break, allowing sunny spells
OL,9,Fto develop here too.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FRemaining largely settled over the
OL,13,Fcoming days with plenty of sunshine.
OL,14,FVery warm, with temperatures rising
OL,15,Ffurther and becoming hot locally by
OL,16,FWednesday. Cooler and less settled
OL,17,Ffrom Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
